<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss jobless rate rises to 4.8 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Swiss jobless rate rises to 4.8 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 4.8 percent in October, up from 4.6 percent in September, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>					 Oct 1996  Sept 1996  Oct 1995</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed	4.8	 4.6	  4.0</p>
<p> Number of jobless		  174,107   166,409    146,364</p>
<p> Job vacancies			  5,344     5,224	4,982</p>
</text>
